      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of King Xorbb [zone=875]\n**Who:**\n- Shimsham Ratlobber [npc=41335]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blue Sapphire [item=108708]\n- Chrom's Hardened Heart [item=108713]\n- Deep Green Emerald [item=108709]\n- Pitch Black Onyx [item=108712]\n- Purple Amethyst [item=108711]\n- Radiant Diamond [item=108707]\n- Red Ruby [item=108710]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Valley of King Xorbb: Find the Gems... Or Die! [zone=899]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Belmoore Bigdigger [npc=42790]\n- Chrom [npc=42783]\n- Chroms Treasure Chest [npc=42782]\n- Griznab Finkledink [npc=42791]\n- a diamond golem [npc=42784]\n- a mine overlord [npc=42780]\n- a ruby golem [npc=42786]\n- a sapphire golem [npc=42787]\n- a sticky slime [npc=42781]\n- a treasure chest [npc=42468]\n- an amethyst golem [npc=42785]\n- an emerald golem [npc=42788]\n- an onyx golem [npc=42789]\n- an ornate chest - Find the Gems... Or Die! [npc=42447]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 06:14:54 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a group mission that begins with Shimsham Ratlobber ( map) in the Valley of King Xorbb at location -65, 300, -455. This loc is in the underground system that is beneath the valley: He is along the western boundary of the large, east-central room of the underground complex._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Shimsham Ratlobber'\nShimsham Ratlobber says 'Help! Someone has stolen something very valuable from me and I need you to get it back for me! I'll give you a bunch of gold if you [help] me!'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nShimsham Ratlobber says 'You are too kind! We need to get my bag of gems back. When you are [ready] to begin, just say the word!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Find the Gems. . . Or Die!'.\nA goblin named Shimsham Ratlobber has asked you to help recover a stolen bag of gems for him. You are a bit suspicious of his request, but agree to help him anyway. Speak with Shimsham's friend, Griznab Finkledink.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nShimsham Ratlobber says 'Off you go then!'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Valley of King Xorbb - Deep Mines.\n\n---\n\n_xorbb.txt map locs for this task:_\nP 1060.0000, -2190.0000, -155.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, diamond\nP 260.0000, -2050.0000, -345.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, blue\nP 735.0000, -2265.0000, -200.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, emerald\nP 1265.0000, -2800.0000, -200.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, ruby\nP 1225.0000, -1510.0000, -200.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, amethyst\nP 1510.0000, -2690.0000, -205.0000, 240, 0, 0, 1, onyx\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Griznab Finkledink 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nYou say, 'Hail, Griznab Finkledink'\nGriznab Finkledink says 'You have just been tricked into competing in every goblin's favorite spectator sport, 'Find the Gems. . . or Die!'. Along the way you will encounter traps, puzzles, and obstacles that can promptly kill you! Aren't you excited?! The rules of this contest are simple; find several gems or die trying! Once you find all six of the gems, place them in Chrom's treasure chest to move on to the next part of the challenge. Nobody has ever won yet, but if you do, we just may let you leave! Fail and you will probably die a horrible death. Off you go then!'\n\n---\n\nLoot the radiant diamond 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nLoot the blue sapphire 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nLoot the deep green emerald 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nLoot the red ruby 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nLoot the purple amethyst 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nLoot the pitch black onyx 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Task Window Says:_ You have been tricked into competing in some sort of sadistic contest. Locate the treasure chests containing a Radiant Diamond, Blue Sapphire, Deep Green Emerald, Red Ruby, Purple Amethyst, Pitch Black Onyx, and loot them.\n_Note: Opening and looting the wrong chests can spawn adds (1-3 at a time) or port you to a different part of the zone._\nRadiant: Diamond: 2190, -1060, -155\nBlue Sapphire: 2050, -260, -345\nDeep Green Emerald: 2265, -735, -200\nRed Ruby: 2800, -1265, -200\nPurple Amethyst: 1510, -1225, -200\nPitch Black Onyx: 2690, -1510, -205\n\n---\n\nPlace the radiant diamond in Chrom's treasure chest 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nPlace the blue sapphire in Chrom's treasure chest 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nPlace the deep green emerald in Chrom's treasure chest 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nPlace the red ruby in Chrom's treasure chest 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nPlace the purple amethyst in Chrom's treasure chest 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nPlace the pitch black onyx in Chrom's treasure chest 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_This triggers the spawn of a golem named \"Chrom\". He appears at the other end of the room and is not auto-aggro._\nThe fearsome golem, Chrom, has appeared and looks anxious to smash you into oblivion!\n\n---\n\nDefeat Chrom 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Chrom hits for a max ~14,000; is permanently rooted; and summons. He spawns two adds at each health mark: 75%, 65%, 55%, 45%, 35%, and 25%. You'll see this emote when they spawn:_\nChrom slams the ground with his mighty fists and the nearby \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ cluster breaks open revealing two angry \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ golems!\n_Adds hit for a max ~12,500. They are stunnable and mezzable._\nLoot Chrom's Hardened Heart 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n\n---\n\nGive Chrom's Hardened Heart to Belmoore Bigdigger 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Task Window Says:_ The burynai nearby named Belmoore Bigdigger that you presumed was dead, has awoken. Give him Chrom's Hardened Heart.\nSpeak with Belmoore Bigdigger 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nYou say, 'Hail, Belmoore Bigdigger'\nBelmoore Bigdigger says 'Thank goodness you defeated that big brute, Chrom! I have been trapped here playing dead for I don't know how long. Chrom's heart is actually a key we can use to summon a portal to get the heck out of here. Wait a minute. . . Oh, look! It appears a treasure chest has appeared! I wonder if anything good is inside? Why don't you loot it and then we can use the teleport portal nearby to get out of these abysmal mines.'\nLoot the chest for your reward 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nYou have managed to escape from the dastardly contest that the goblin, Shimsham Ratlobber tricked you into competing in. Belmoore Bigdigger, who was also trapped in the mines, thanks you and goes on his way.\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience\n_Possible Chest Loot (1 Item + 1 Dreadmote per task):_\nEar Pendant of the Pauper\nGorget of the Bosque Defender\nGruden's Bone Girdle\nIcy Grasp\nPanic Attack\nRooting Weight\nSapping Sliver\nSash of Seeping Awareness\nSights Unseen\nSunbeam Bow\nLesser Dreadmote\nMedian Dreadmote\nGreater Dreadmote\nGlowing Dreadmote\n_Note: \"Xorlex's Towering Prosperity\" can also drop as a bonus item in the chest._\n- Ear Pendant of the Pauper [item=109231]\n- Glowing Dreadmote [item=106497]\n- Gorget of the Bosque Defender [item=109422]\n- Greater Dreadmote [item=106464]\n- Gruden's Bone Girdle [item=108892]\n- Icy Grasp [item=109722]\n- Lesser Dreadmote [item=106476]\n- Median Dreadmote [item=106509]\n- Panic Attack [item=108207]\n- Rooting Weight [item=108714]\n- Sapping Sliver [item=109195]\n- Sash of Seeping Awareness [item=109721]\n- Sights Unseen [item=108154]\n- Sunbeam Bow [item=107894]\n- Xorlex's Towering Prosperity [item=108773]",
