      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of King Xorbb [zone=875]\n**Who:**\n- a cowardly scout [npc=41354]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Minotaur Horn [item=108658]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bruiser minotaur [npc=42325]\n- a guardian minotaur [npc=42359]\n- a minotaur architect [npc=42367]\n- a minotaur cook [npc=42368]\n- a scholarly minotaur [npc=42381]\n- a shamanic minotaur [npc=42151]\n- a warrior minotaur [npc=42398]\n- a watchman minotaur [npc=42399]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 10:10:49 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with \"a cowardly scout\" ( map) in the Valley of King Xorbb. He's located at -1645, -900, 115 (near the zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, a cowardly scout'\na cowardly scout says 'They're everywhere! Everywhere!!! Please help me! I was up for retirement in a few months, instead, I was sent to war! TO WAR!!! I know nothing of war! All I wanted was all the glory and fortune of a military career, not this! I beg of you, if I can prove I did my part, maybe I can [convince] my superiors to send me home. I'm so scared!!!'\nYou say, 'How can you convince them?'\na cowardly scout says 'Look around you!!! Minotaurs, Elementals, Muddites and Whirlwinds and Cyclones oh my! They're all around us! Slay them and bring proof so I can show my superiors I did my fair share.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Theseus' Job'.\nThe halfling wants you to slay some minotaurs so he can prove he has done his part in the fight.\n\n---\n\nSlay some minotaurs and collect proof 0/10 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Task Window Says:_ The Minotaurs are scattered through Xorbb, the Valley of Kings.\n_You'll receive horns in your inventory as you kill minotaurs._\nGive the cowardly scout the horns so he can prove he killed the Minotaurs 0/10 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
