says 'You? You would go find the pieces to my dearest? Oh lovely... That would be just lovely if you could find my dearest... I mean... Find the pieces so I could make another one. You'll need to find some Osmium ore to forge the ring, Purified Direflame to generate enough heat, ancient words of power to imbue the magic within, and some binding residue to tie it all together... Ah yes... Find the pieces to make a new one. My dearest...'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Ain't No Thing Like an Evil Ring'.\nZerkis wants you to search for pieces he needs to create a new ring of power.\nYou'll need to find a piece of Osmium Ore, some magical binding residue, Purified Direflame, and Ancient Words of Power, whatever those might be.\n\n---\n\nCollect Binding Residue 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nCollect Osmium Ore 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nCollect Purified Direflame 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nCollect Ancient Text of Power 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nDeliver the Binding Residue to Zerkis 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nDeliver the Osmium to Zerkis 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nGive the Purified Direflame to Zerkis 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nGive the Ancient Text of Power to Zerkis 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_You receive \"Ring of Binding\"._\nBind a weakened eye to the ring 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_With any evil eye in your target (and under 30% health), right-click the ring to change it into an \"Empowered Ring of Binding\" (mob despawns)._\nReturn the empowered ring to Zerkis 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Note: The reward for this task may be bugged, but you will get completion credit._\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (3 AAs)\nRing of Watching Eyes\n- Ring of Watching Eyes [item=107687]",
