ll fear da Krystul King! Gronk have all da shinies and he stand on the shiniest of dem all! You fear Gronk, and dat's why you [find] Gronk more.'\nYou say, 'What about these shinies?'\nGronk the Krystul King clutches his crystal-studded club like a baby and eyes you suspiciously, 'What you want with shinies? All da shinies are Gronk's.' A smiles crosses Gronk's face as he reaches out and puts his heavy hand on your shoulder, 'Maybe you [find] Gronk shinies and Gronk not crush you.'\nYou say, 'I could find some'\nGronk the Krystul King says 'Go into caves to north. Caves filled with shinies. Get me more. Kill any shorty halflings you find to make da Krystul King pleased. Maybe Gronk let you keep one if nice.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Krystuls for the Krystul King'.\nYou've encountered a large ogre who seems to be immune from the effects of the fear shard. You'll need to gain his confidence to get him to tell you his secret to avoiding its effects.\n\n---\n\n_Note: You need to follow all dialogues with Gronk to get the hail/speaking updates._\nCollect blue crystals 0/3 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nCollect yellow crystals 0/3 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nCollect red crystals 0/3 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nCollect green crystals 0/3 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Task Window Says:_ Collect some of the blue crystals he's obsessed with to offer as tribute. Find them in the caves to the north. Continue north out of the blue crystal cave and head east to find a large clump of yellow crystals. Red crystals can be found in the northernmost caves, connected to the large cavern that houses the yellow crystals. Green crystals are the most difficult to find. Search the caves to the west for them.\n_The crystals are ground spawns in the areas just north of Gronk (blue ones in the room to the north of Gronk; yellow ones in the next room north; red ones in the room north of there; and green ones in the room to the west of the yellow spawns)._\nBring the crystals to Gronk 0/12 (Valley of King 