      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of King Xorbb [zone=875]\n**Who:**\n- Pickslave Lurr [npc=41358]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Concoction of Burning Agony [item=109058]\n- Distillate of Tears [item=109060]\n- Dozing Evil Eye [item=109063]\n- Essence of Blindness [item=109049]\n- Ground Black Pepper [item=109057]\n- Ragweed [item=109051]\n- Scrap of Blanket [item=109061]\n- Silvern Phial [item=109059]\n- Silvern Phial [item=109056]\n- Silvern Phial [item=108686]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a blackened eye [npc=42443]\n- a clayborn muddite [npc=42326]\n- a creekbottom muddite [npc=42334]\n- a farsighted eye [npc=42348]\n- a fleshburn mephit [npc=42352]\n- a focused eye [npc=42353]\n- a geosplint mephit [npc=42356]\n- a longfang rat [npc=42365]\n- a magician`s eye [npc=42366]\n- a noxious spill [npc=42373]\n- a riverfoam elemental [npc=42379]\n- a runny eye [npc=42445]\n- a sewer rat - Valley of King Xorbb - 1 [npc=42383]\n- a streamswell elemental [npc=42390]\n- an eskerdirt muddite [npc=42406]\n- an irritated eye [npc=42444]\n- an omnifocus eye [npc=42411]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 10:11:04 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task begins with Pickslave Lurr ( map) in the Valley of King Xorbb. He's found at -1400, 1150, -312. This is in the underground system. At the bottom of the waterfall in the southwestern part of the valley are two bridges that criss-cross. Lurr is found in the tunnel that extends east from the lower bridge._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Pickslave Lurr'\nPickslave Lurr glances briefly at you and mutters under his breath, '[Flarglegrump ak murgledoo]! That is Goblin for \"I hate you!\"'.\nYou say, 'You hate me?'\nPickslave Lurr says 'Argh! So it was, as it must be. The one who bound you here was me.'\nPickslave Lurr says 'Now our [cause] you must protect, or by our vengeance, you'll be wrecked!'\nYou say, 'What cause?'\nPickslave Lurr says 'Eyes once caught we must seal once more, if our rightful place we would restore.'\nPickslave Lurr says 'A secret [serum] long forgot shall switch us with our \"Master's\" spot.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about this serum?'\nPickslave Lurr says 'By blindness only can our foes be brought to task, so bring me quickly what I ask:'\nPickslave Lurr says 'A [wisp] of smoke, some muddite mud, and a drop of blackest mephit blood.'\nYou say, 'What wisp?'\n_You receive a \"Silvern Phial\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'An Eye for an Eye'.\nLurr has enlisted you to assist him in finding a way to overthrow the evil eyes.\n\n---\n\nUse the Silvern Phial to gather some smoke from one of the minotaurs' campfires 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Around minotaur campfires in the valley are mobs called \"a cloud of smoke\". Right-click the Phial on one of these for this update._\nCollect some mud from the muddites near the river 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Updates upon muddite kills._\nCollect some blood from a mephit 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Updates upon mephit kills._\nReturn to Pickslave Lurr 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nUse the Essence of Blindness on an Evil Eye 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Right-click the Essence of Blindness on any evil eye._\nDefend yourself against the Blackened Eye! 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_You'll need to kill it._\nReport to Pickslave Lurr and tell him of the results 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nUse the Silvern Phial to collect some fluid from a spill in the sewers 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Target an ooze and right-click on the Silvern Phial for this update._\nFind where the goblins are storing their food, and obtain some ground black pepper 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_This is a ground spawn in the bar / kitchen area at about -725, 730, -345 (same vicinity as Gerbril the Cook)._\nCollect some scratchy rat fur 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Updates upon rat kills (in underground system)._\nReturn to Pickslave Lurr 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nUse the Concoction of Burning Agony on an Evil Eye 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Right-click the Concoction on any evil eye._\nDefend yourself against the Irritated Eye! 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Again, you'll need to kill it._\nReport to Pickslave Lurr and tell him of the results 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nUse the Silvern Phial to collect some clear water from water elementals 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Right-click the Silvern Phial on any water elemental._\nCollect some ragweed from the riverbank in the valley 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_This is a ground spawn on the northwest side of the river at about 1015, 340, -30 (appears as a small bush on the ground). This /loc is a little ways northeast of the minotaur architect camp in the north-central part of the valley._\n_There is also a ragweed ground spawn on the rocks where the river enters the cavern at -1175, 1440, -105._\nReturn to Pickslave Lurr 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\nUse the Distillate of Tears on an Evil Eye 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Right-click the Distillate on any evil eye._\nCapture the Runny Eye! 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Target the evil eye and right-click the Scrap of Blanket._\nDeliver 1 Dozing Evil Eye to Pickslave Lurr 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (3 AAs)",
