      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Valley of King Xorbb [zone=875]\n**Who:**\n- Oolab [npc=41355]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a deepwoods snake [npc=42346]\n- a forest snake [npc=42355]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 10:11:11 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Oolab ( map) in the Valley of King Xorbb. He's located at -1600, -1180, 105 (just past the gate east of the zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Oolab'\nOolab says 'Psst! Over here! Don't mind my disguise, I'm a halfling scout in incognito. Sounds great huh? Well, it's not. This forest is full of wild animals. My friends and I have been getting torn apart by these beasts. I'll tell you what, slay some bears and snakes for us, and we'll make it worth your while. Now [shoo], you're breaking my cover!'\nYou say, 'Shoo?!'\nOolab says 'The nights are cold out here and we're short on food. If you slay those wild creatures, my invisible disguised friends can get some furs and meat. Don't be surprised if you never get a glimpse of them, they're masters of camouflage. Just do your part and don't worry. The bears and snakes are all over the forest, go get them tiger!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Snakes in the Grass'.\nThe, erm, \"Bear\" wants you to kill some snakes so that his companions can get the meat and skin. Just worry about the slaying part.\n\n---\n\nSlay the snakes creeping around the forest 0/10 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Task Window Says:_ The snakes creep in the grass all over the forest, they don't look very appetizing at all but their skin could make for some fancy footwear.\nReturn to Oolab 0/1 (Valley of King Xorbb)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
